From: Dmitry Muhomor <muhomor.dmitry@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 May 2024 19:55:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add duress password management UI

Port the GrapheneOS duress PIN and password UI to LineageOS 24. Use platform credential confirmation for the system owner and provide a Lock screen fallback for builds using the legacy Safety Center UI. Adapt resource and validation APIs to the pinned Settings source.

